      en: ["Destination wedding in Santorini with {a.first}. Sunset, white outfits, 80 guests… and a ferry strike stranding 60 of them on another island.", "Dream wedding in Bali with {a.first}. On the big day: monsoon. The officiant is drunk. The buffet was devoured by monkeys."],
