      en: ["The phone rings on a Tuesday at 10:12 a.m. 'Hello, this is the adoption agency. There's a child waiting for you.' You sit down on the floor, right where you are.", "After months of waiting, the letter arrived: a child is joining your family. You read it eleven times. Then once more."],
